id=axion_spsm
name=Axion Super Power Saving
version=v3.9.0
versionCode=76
author=Axion SPSM
description=v3.9.0, the daily round: the activation and the exit got their seconds back from four measured lies - the package lists were rebuilt three times per activation on a phone that answers every pm call slowly (one build per run now), the protected-list cache was written to /tmp, which does not exist on Android (it lives in the module's own scratch now), the after-read of a 187-app suspension raced PackageManager's own flush and reported "no visible change" (the applied reading comes from what pm confirmed), and the exit released 187 force-stops one su-fork at a time (six at a time now, like every other fan). Settings knobs journal their own writes and skip the second settings pass; the sweep's note tells the truth; the screen-off progress file no longer outlives the transition.
